From c8b9c339b20059e3805dfa34a4ad605839c76a50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwqgong-ui <noreply@qwqgong-ui.local>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 17:02:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hysteria2: vectorize Salamander payload XOR

Use AVX2 on supported amd64 CPUs and NEON on arm64 to process the repeating 32-byte BLAKE2b key one vector block at a time. Keep a scalar fallback for other architectures and purego builds.

The helper accepts separate, in-place, and forward-overlapping buffers so Salamander can decrypt while removing its salt without adding a memmove. Gecko automatically uses the same path through its wrapped Salamander PacketConn.
